","runtime":"35 min","description":"James og Adam Price lander i 1900-tallets Danmark, hvor den kulinariske galskab blomstrer og hvor maden bliver mere og mere mrkelig. Brodrene kaster sig frygtlost over nogle af efterkrigstidens mest tvivlsomme klassikere - inklusive en \"skinke-banan-rulle med ostesauce\", der udfordrer bade menneskehedens udvikling, almindelig stetik, logik og ikke mindst smagslog. Undervejs forsoger de at holde styr pa velfrdsstat, kokkenmaskiner og mrkelig madmode, mens de tester, om retter som \"Tunfiske-moussé med Jeffy Remouladesauce\" fortjener en renssance eller bor blive i historiebogerne."},{"id":"kepg_pl_d50bca7186e50a11ff54e7fa_epg_1795973400","title":"TVA","released":"2026-11-29T17:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T17:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T18:00:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_d50bca7186e50a11ff54e7fa_epg_1795975200","title":"Sma dyr pa episke rejser (3:3)","released":"2026-11-29T18:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T18:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T19:00:00Z","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_d50bca7186e50a11ff54e7fa_epg_1795978800","title":"Danmark synger julen ind","released":"2026-11-29T19:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T19:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T20:00:00Z","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_d50bca7186e50a11ff54e7fa_epg_1795982400","title":"TVA","released":"2026-11-29T20:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T20:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T20:15:00Z","runtime":"15 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_d50bca7186e50a11ff54e7fa_epg_1795983300","title":"Verdenssituationen med Clement","released":"2026-11-29T20:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T20:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T20:45:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_d50bca7186e50a11ff54e7fa_epg_1795985100","title":"Sportsmagasinet","released":"2026-11-29T20:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T20:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T21:15:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_d50bca7186e50a11ff54e7fa_epg_1795986900","title":"Hustrumorderen","released":"2026-11-29T21:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-1